<p>Maqtal Me Tha Jo Laasha-E Asghar Tamaam Raat<br />
Jangal Me Dhoondti Rahi Maadar Tamaam Raat<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Uriyaa'n Thi Laash-E Shamma-E Shabistaan-E Mustafa<br />
Parwaana Waar Phirti Thi qwaahar Tamaam Raat<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Baba Ko Yaad Karke Sakina Na Sothi Thi<br />
Usko Na Chain Aata Tha Dum Bhar Tamaam Raat<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Ro Ro Ke Haaye Aapne Chacha Ko Pukaar Kar<br />
Baali Sakina Maanga Ki Gauhar Tamaam Raat<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Ek Be Watan Ke Qatl Ki Tayyariyaa'n Jo The<br />
Barpaa Tha Fouj-E Shaam Me Mehshar Tamaam Raat<br />
____________________________________</p>

<p>Qabze Ko Choomte Rahe Talwaar Toul Kar<br />
Shouq-E Jihaad Me Rahe Akbar Tamaam Raat<br />
</p>